WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.720
Speaker 1: This is an unbelievable story.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.230
You know, the right loves to talk about ballot
drop boxes.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.219
They're bad, they're not secure or they're
unreliable.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:17.610
And yet the reason that they are not as trusted
by some Americans is because Republicans are

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.960
saying you can't trust them.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.500
It's a self-fulfilling prophecy.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.000
It's a vicious circle.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.200
It's endless.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:30.439
And now individuals believed to be right wingers
have been spotted, in some cases armed at

00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:33.110
Arizona ballot drop boxes.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:39.489
Arizona Secretary of State Katie Hobbs received
a report this week about an alleged incident

00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:41.840
of voter intimidation.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.670
Video was obtained by The Washington Post.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.899
And we're going to play the video here for
you.

00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:48.020
And I will describe what is visible.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:55.070
There is a man who parks at one of these ballot
drop boxes and he walks over and he dumps

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.500
in his ballot.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.760
Perfectly legal.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:58.840
That's what it's there for.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.300
This was on October 17th.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.649
This is an early voting drop box.

00:01:03.649 --> 00:01:07.680
And what you see is that after he walks away.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:10.310
Something gets his attention right across
the street.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.810
He's he's apparently engaging with someone
right across the street.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:18.560
And it seems to start to become sort of combative.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.600
And the man later reported that he was being
watched, he was being photographed, and he

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.229
was being heckled as he used that ballot drop
box.

00:01:26.229 --> 00:01:29.110
And again, if you're listening, I'm describing
what's on video.

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:33.900
The individual eventually getting into his
car, backing up and ultimately driving away.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:40.800
But what he says happened was that people
were harassing him for using that drop box.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.640
And he ultimately decided to.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:47.140
Seems like back all the way out and go in
a different direction.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.100
That is exhibit number one.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:56.469
We then learned about on Friday, two armed
individuals dressed in tactical gear showed

00:01:56.469 --> 00:01:59.950
up at a mesa, Arizona, ballot drop box.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.100
We have pictures here.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:09.410
Eventually, the Maricopa County Sheriff's
Office arrived and the individuals left.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:13.860
There are folks here you see wearing I don't
even know the terms for this stuff.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:20.870
They've got like a I can't tell if that is
a leg, a band, a leg holster of some kind

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.000
with one individual.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.830
They seem to have a tactical vest, possibly
a camera.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.190
Who knows what it is that that they all have.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:33.360
But reportedly armed individuals in tactical
gear.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:44.040
Again, allegedly, they're too apparently there
to harass and intimidate and all of the things

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.349
that you would imagine they would be doing.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:53.599
And then there is an additional report of
people just hanging out outside Maricopa County

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:57.430
elections headquarters in Arizona, outside
one of two ballot drop boxes.

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:59.330
They have their own cameras rolling.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.360
They are filming the drop boxes.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.709
And here are people and they're all playing
coy.

00:03:04.709 --> 00:03:06.490
I can't really tell you what I'm doing here.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:14.060
Check this out.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:17.920
So what we're seeing right now is just a bunch
of cameras pointing at the drop boxes.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:28.430
Speaker 2: What was the name of the group
you're with again?

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.049
Clean Elections USA.

00:03:31.049 --> 00:03:34.060
Speaker 1: Clean Elections USA.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:37.720
Speaker 2: And you've been out here how long?

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:46.530
Speaker 1: I can't answer that.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:52.100
Okay.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:56.489
They claim that they have not said anything
to people dropping off ballots.

00:03:56.489 --> 00:03:59.550
They just have cameras pointed at the drop
boxes.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:06.370
They have, you know, a dog, a bunch of cameras,
food, etc., etc..

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.810
Now, individually.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:13.349
Is it against the law to just have a camera
across the parking lot from a Dropbox?

00:04:13.349 --> 00:04:14.489
I don't know.

00:04:14.489 --> 00:04:15.489
I don't know.

00:04:15.489 --> 00:04:17.500
And that's what's being explored right now.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:22.150
But the totality of what's going on in Arizona
and I don't care who's doing it, if you came

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:25.251
to me with tears in your eyes and said, Sir,
these are all Democrats, I would say it's

00:04:25.251 --> 00:04:27.060
still wrong.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.669
I don't care who's doing it.

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:31.610
This is all a form of voter intimidation.

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:39.350
And there's also a story here of what appears
to be essentially inaction by law enforcement,

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:43.660
which is another part of this that we're exploring
and may have more information about about

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.540
for you tomorrow.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:46.540
They are.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.750
You know, it's the other day, Marco Rubio.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.530
Marco Rubio said, listen.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.110
People don't trust these ballot drop boxes.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.110
Right.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.419
But they don't trust them because you told
them they shouldn't be trusted.

00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:58.500
It's completely circular in every way.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:03.260
And now in order to set to be able to justify
their own claims that these drop boxes are

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:08.320
just trouble, they are creating trouble at
the drop boxes.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.100
These are horrible people.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:14.390
This is not pro-democracy behavior by any
means.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.530
And we have to see to it that it is stopped
in Arizona

